  "details": "Steamvr trackers are legendarily impossible to turn off, especially when charging. If i use just 3 trackers, and have my others on the charger, they still are recognized in steamvr and vrchat, and mess up calibration in vrc. I would like an option to force different tracker setups, like just 6 point, even if more trackers are recognized. Temporary fix is to wrap the charging trackers in aluminum foil and turn them off through the steamvr ui.",
